# Hitch marks in quick succession, in play (DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1, SAVES= a save
# at the castle): "MARK n" on screen grows a digit at 10 and at 100, and each
# time the overlay's staging buffer is made again -- where three soaks crashed
# inside the NVIDIA driver (2026-11-02). 120 marks, 0.3 s apart.
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press CROSS                 # "Change characters?" NO
state life>0,area==17 90
sleep 3
loop 120
  touch mark.trigger
  sleep 0.3
end
sleep 5
